\v 18 Then¦336887 Yahweh's¦336889 \add ≈brilliant light\add* moved¦336887 out¦336887 over the¦336891 \add ≈temple¦336892\add* threshold¦336891 and¦336893 stayed over the¦336896 winged creatures.
\v 19 The¦336899 winged creatures lifted¦336898 up¦336898 their¦336902 wings¦336902 and¦336903 rose¦336903 from¦336904 the¦336906 ground¦336906 in my¦336907 sight¦336907 when¦336908 they¦336908 travelled¦336908, and¦336909 the¦336909 wheels¦336909 did the same beside¦336910 them¦336910. They stood¦336911 at the¦336912 eastern¦336917 entrance¦336912 to Yahweh's¦336916 residence, and¦336918 the¦336918 \add ≈brilliant light\add* of¦336918 Yisrael's¦336921 \add !(Israel¦336921)\add* god¦336919 came¦336908 onto them¦336922 from¦336923 above¦336923.
\v 20 Those were the¦336926 living¦336926 creatures that¦336927 I'd¦336928 seen¦336928 below Yisrael's¦336932 god¦336930 by the¦336933 Kevar¦336935 Canal, so¦336936 I¦336936 knew¦336936 that¦336937 they¦336939 were winged creatures.
\p
\v 21 They each had four faces¦336943 and¦336945 four¦336945 wings¦336946, and¦336948 had something like human¦336950 hands¦336949 under¦336951 their¦336952 wings,
\v 22 and¦336954 their¦336955 faces¦336955 \add ≈resembled\add* the¦336957 faces¦336957 that¦336958 I'd¦336959 seen¦336959 in the vision at¦336960 the¦336962 Kevar¦336964 Canal, and¦336966 each¦336967 of¦336970 them went¦336972 straight ahead.
\c 11
