\v 1 Then¦336974 the spirit¦336976 lifted¦336974 me up¦336974 and¦336977 brought¦336977 me¦336978 to¦336979 the¦336981 eastern¦336985 gate¦336981 of¦336981 Yahweh's¦336984 \add ≈temple¦336982\add*, facing¦336986 east¦336987, and¦336988 wow¦336988, in the¦336989 doorway¦336989 of¦336989 the¦336990 gate¦336990 there were twenty-five men¦336993. Among¦336995 them I saw¦336994 Azur's¦337001 son Ya’azanyah¦336998 and¦337002 Benayah's¦337007 son Pelatyah¦337004, \add who were\add* leaders¦337008 of¦337008 the¦337009 people¦337009.
\p
\v 2 \add @Yahweh¦337012\add* told¦337012 me¦337013, “Son¦337014 of¦337014 humanity¦337016, these¦337017 are¦337018 the¦337018 men¦337018 who¦337019 \add ≈plan¦337019 to do evil¦337020 things\add* and¦337021 who¦337021 make \add ≈wicked¦337024\add* plans in¦337025 this¦337026 city¦337025.
\v 3 They're saying¦337028, ‘\add ≈This isn't¦337029 yet\add* the¦337030 time to¦337031 build¦337031 houses¦337032. This city is¦337034 \add like a cooking\add* pot¦337034, and¦337035 we're¦337035 the¦337036 meat¦337036.’
\v 4 So¦337038, prophesy¦337039 against them¦337040, son¦337042 of¦337042 humanity¦337044, \add start\add* prophesying.”
\p
\v 5 Then¦337046 Yahweh's spirit came on¦337047 me¦337047 and¦337050 told¦337050 me to¦337051 say¦337052: This is what Yahweh¦337056 says¦337055, “That's what you¦337058 Israeli¦337060 \add ≈people\add* are saying¦337058, because I know¦337064 what goes through your mind.
\v 6 You've¦337066 killed¦337067 \add ≈many people\add* in¦337068 this¦337069 city¦337068, and¦337070 filled¦337070 its¦337071 streets¦337071 with them.
\p
\v 7 Therefore the master¦337079 Yahweh¦337080 says¦337078: The people you've killed¦337081, whose bodies you've¦337083 laid¦337083 in¦337084 the¦337084 middle¦337084 of¦337084 \add @Yerushalem¦337084\add* \add !(Jerusalem¦337084)\add*, are¦337086 the¦337086 meat¦337086, and¦337087 this city is¦337088 the¦337088 pot¦337088. But¦337089 you¦337089 \add people\add* are going to be brought¦337090 out¦337090 from¦337091 the¦337091 centre of¦337091 this city.
\v 8 You've¦337094 feared¦337094 the sword¦337095, so¦337095 I'm¦337096 bringing¦337096 the sword against you¦337097. That's my¦337099 master¦337099 Yahweh's¦337100 declaration¦337098.
\v 9 I'll¦337102 bring¦337102 you out¦337102 from¦337104 the¦337104 city, and¦337105 put you¦337106 into¦337107 the¦337107 \add #hands¦337107\add* of¦337107 foreigners¦337109, because I'll¦337110 bring¦337110 \add #judgement¦337112\add* against you¦337111 \add people\add*.
\v 10 You'll¦337115 \add ≈be killed\add* by¦337114 the sword¦337114. I'll¦337120 judge¦337120 you¦337121 within Yisrael's¦337119 \add !(Israel¦337119)\add* borders¦337118 so¦337122 that you¦337122 \add people\add* will¦337122 know¦337122 that¦337123 I¦337125 am¦337126 Yahweh¦337126.
\v 11 This city won't¦337129 be your cooking pot¦337133, nor will you be the¦337136 meat¦337137 inside¦337136 it¦337136. I'll¦337142 judge¦337142 you¦337143 \add people\add* within Yisrael's¦337141 \add #borders¦337140\add*.
\v 12 Then¦337145 you'll¦337145 know¦337145 that¦337146 I¦337148 am¦337149 Yahweh¦337149, the one whose instructions¦337151 you¦337153 haven't \add ≈obeyed\add* and¦337154 whose regulations¦337151 you haven't \add ≈followed\add*. Instead, you people have¦337156 \add imitated\add* the¦337157 \add wicked\add* \add ≈customs\add* of¦337157 the¦337158 nations¦337158 that¦337159 surround¦337160 you.”
\p
\v 13 Then¦337163 as¦337164 I¦337164 was¦337163 prophesying¦337164, Benayah's¦337168 son¦337166 Pelatyah¦337165 died¦337169. \add ≈So¦337170\add* I¦337170 fell¦337170 \add ≈to my knees with my face¦337173 bowed low to the ground\add* and¦337174 cried¦337174 out¦337174 with a¦337175 loud voice¦337175, “Oh no, my¦337180 master¦337180 Yahweh¦337181, will you¦337183 completely¦337182 \add ≈eliminate the¦337186 Israeli¦337187 people\add*?”
\s1 Yahweh's promise to the exiles
\rem /s1 Hope for Exiled Israel; God's Promise to the Exiles; God Will Restore Israel
