\v 14 Then¦337190 Yahweh¦337193 \add ≈gave me¦337194 this\add* message¦337191:
\v 15 “Your brothers, son¦337197 of¦337197 humanity¦337199, your¦337200 brothers¦337201 and¦337204 all¦337204 the¦337206 \add ≈Israeli¦337207 people¦337202 who were¦337209 exiled\add*—the¦337212 ones living¦337212 in Yerushalem¦337213 \add !(Jerusalem¦337213)\add* say¦337210 about them¦337211 all, ‘They're far away from¦337215 Yahweh¦337216. \em This land¦337220\em* was¦337219 given¦337219 to¦337217 us¦337217 as \add ≈ours to¦337221 own¦337221\add*.’
