\v 16 So¦337224 tell¦337225 \add them\add*, ‘My¦337229 master¦337229 Yahweh¦337230 says¦337228 this: ‘Although I've¦337232 removed¦337232 them¦337232 far¦337232 away¦337232 \add ≈to other\add* nations¦337233, and¦337234 though I've¦337235 scattered¦337235 them¦337235 among¦337236 \add &those\add* lands¦337236, I¦337237 myself have¦337237 been a \add ≈place of security\add* for¦337238 them¦337238 for a¦337240 little¦337240 while in¦337241 the lands¦337241 where¦337242 they¦337244 \add ≈were taken\add*.’
\p
\v 17 So¦337248 \add explain\add* \add to them\add*, ‘My¦337253 master¦337253 Yahweh¦337254 says¦337252 this: ‘I'll¦337255 gather¦337255 you¦337256 from¦337257 the¦337259 people¦337259 groups, and¦337260 assemble¦337260 you¦337261 from¦337262 the¦337264 lands¦337264 where you¦337266 were¦337266 scattered¦337266, and¦337268 I'll¦337268 give¦337268 you¦337269 \add back\add* the¦337272 \add ≈country¦337272\add* of¦337272 Yisrael¦337273 \add !(Israel¦337273)\add*.’
\v 18 Then¦337275 they'll¦337275 go there and¦337278 remove¦337278 every¦337281 detestable¦337283 and¦337284 disgusting \add #thing¦337283\add* from¦337289 there,
\v 19 and¦337291 I'll¦337291 give¦337291 them¦337292 one¦337294 heart, and¦337295 I'll¦337297 put¦337297 a new¦337296 spirit¦337295 in¦337298 them. I'll¦337299 take¦337299 the¦337300 \add ≈rock-hard¦337301\add* heart¦337300 out of \add ≈them\add* and¦337303 give¦337303 them¦337304 \add ≈a¦337305 tender heart¦337305\add*,\x + \xo 11:19-20: \xt Eze 36:26-28.\x*
\v 20 so¦337308 that¦337308 they'll¦337310 \add ≈follow¦337310 my instructions and obey my regulations¦337309\add*. Then they'll be¦337317 my people¦337320, and¦337321 I'll¦337322 be their god¦337324.
\v 21 \add ≈But¦337326\add* to¦337326 those who \add ≈would rather happily choose\add* their¦337329 detestable¦337329 and¦337330 disgusting ways, I'll¦337335 \add ≈make their actions¦337333 bounce back\add* onto their¦337334 own¦337334 \add #heads¦337334\add*. That's the¦337336 master¦337337 Yahweh's¦337338 declaration¦337336.”
