\p
\v 22 Then¦337340 the¦337341 winged creatures lifted¦337340 up¦337340 their¦337344 wings¦337344 and¦337345 the¦337345 wheels¦337345 that were¦337346 beside¦337346 them¦337346, and¦337347 the¦337347 \add ≈brilliant light\add* of¦337347 Yisrael's¦337350 \add !(Israel¦337350)\add* god¦337348 was¦337351 up high over them¦337351.\x + \xo 11:22-23: \xt Eze 43:2-5.\x*
\v 23 Then¦337354 \add *it¦337356\add* went up from¦337357 the¦337358 centre¦337358 of¦337358 the¦337359 city¦337359 and¦337360 \add ≈sat above¦337361\add* the¦337363 mountain¦337363 to the east¦337365 of¦337366 the city¦337366.
\v 24 The spirit¦337368 lifted¦337369 me¦337369 up¦337369 and¦337370 brought¦337370 me¦337370 into¦337371 the land of the Kasdim¦337371 \add !(Chaldeans¦337371)\add* to¦337372 the¦337374 exiles¦337374, in¦337375 the vision from God's¦337377 spirit, and¦337378 the¦337380 vision¦337380 that¦337381 I'd¦337382 been seeing¦337382 left me,
\v 25 and¦337384 I¦337384 told¦337384 the¦337387 exiles¦337387 everything Yahweh¦337392 had¦337394 shown¦337394 me¦337394.
\c 12
\s1 Portraying the future exile
