\v 17 Then¦337675 Yahweh¦337678 \add ≈gave me¦337679\add* \add another\add* message¦337676:
\v 18 “Son¦337682 of¦337682 humanity¦337684, eat¦337687 your¦337685 food¦337685 \add ≈while trembling¦337689 with fear\add*, and¦337690 drink¦337691 your¦337688 water¦337688 \add ≈while shaking anxiously\add*,
\v 19 and¦337693 tell¦337693 the¦337696 people¦337696 in \add ≈this country¦337697\add*, ‘My¦337701 master¦337701 Yahweh¦337702 says¦337700 this about¦337704 the¦337703 inhabitants¦337703 of¦337703 Yerushalem¦337704 \add !(Jerusalem¦337704)\add*, and the¦337707 \add ≈country¦337707\add* of¦337707 Yisrael¦337708 \add !(Israel¦337708)\add*, “They'll¦337711 anxiously eat¦337711 their¦337709 food¦337709 and¦337712 fearfully drink¦337714 their¦337712 water¦337712, since \add ≈all the abundance from the land¦337717 will be¦337716 devastated¦337716\add* because of¦337718 the¦337719 violence¦337719 of¦337719 all¦337720 \add the people\add* who live¦337722 there.
\v 20 The¦337726 inhabited¦337726 cities¦337725 will¦337727 become desolate¦337727, and¦337728 the¦337728 land¦337728 \add itself\add* will¦337730 become¦337730 a wasteland. Then¦337731 you'll¦337731 know¦337731 that¦337732 I¦337734 am¦337735 Yahweh¦337735.” ’ ”
\s1 Just because it never came true before…
