\p
\v 21 Then¦337738 Yahweh¦337741 \add ≈gave me¦337742\add* \add another\add* message¦337739:
\v 22 “Son¦337745 of¦337745 humanity¦337747, what's¦337748 that¦337751 saying¦337757 that you¦337752 have in Yisrael¦337756 \add !(Israel¦337756)\add*? It goes, ‘The¦337759 days¦337759 \add ≈seem to go on and¦337760 on, yet no prophecy ever comes true.\add*’
\v 23 So¦337765 tell¦337766 them¦337767, ‘This¦337777 is what the master¦337771 Yahweh¦337772 says¦337770: I'm¦337773 going to¦337773 prove that¦337777 what they say isn't¦337778 correct, then they'll never say it¦337781 again¦337782 in¦337783 Yisrael¦337783.’ Tell¦337787 them¦337788, ‘It'll soon be the¦337790 time¦337790 when¦337791 everything that the¦337791 prophets have¦337789 predicted will happen,
\v 24 because¦337796 there'll no longer be¦337798 any¦337800 false \add #visions¦337802\add* or \add ≈people-pleasing prophecies¦337804\add* within Yisrael¦337808.
\v 25 I speak, and I \add ≈put the words that¦337816 I¦337817 speak¦337817 into action\add*, because I am¦337819 Yahweh. The matter will¦337821 no longer be¦337821 delayed, because¦337823 I'll¦337827 speak¦337827 this message¦337828 in your \add ≈lifetimes¦337824\add*, \add you\add* rebellious¦337826 \add ≈people\add*, and¦337829 then I'll¦337829 carry it¦337829 out!’ That's the¦337830 master¦337831 Yahweh's¦337832 declaration.”
\p
\v 26 Then¦337835 Yahweh¦337838 \add ≈gave me¦337839\add* \add another\add* message¦337836:
\v 27 “Listen, son¦337842 of¦337842 humanity¦337844, the¦337846 \add ≈Israeli¦337848 people\add* have said¦337849, ‘The¦337850 vision¦337850 that¦337851 \add @the¦337853 prophet¦337853\add* sees¦337854 is¦337855 for many¦337856 years from now, and¦337857 he¦337859 prophesies¦337860 about far-off times¦337857,’
