\p
\v 1 Then¦337885 Yahweh¦337888 \add ≈gave me¦337889\add* \add another\add* message¦337886:
\v 2 “Son¦337892 of¦337892 humanity¦337894, prophesy¦337895 against¦337896 the¦337898 prophets¦337898 who¦337900 are¦337900 prophesying¦337900 in Yisrael¦337899 \add !(Israel¦337899)\add*, and¦337901 tell¦337901 those who are prophesying out of¦337902 their¦337903 own¦337903 imaginations, ‘Listen¦337904 to Yahweh's¦337907 message¦337905.
\v 3 My¦337911 master¦337911 Yahweh¦337912 says¦337910 this: ‘Foolish¦337917 prophets¦337916 who¦337918 follow their¦337921 own¦337921 spirit¦337921 and¦337922 haven't \add actually\add* seen¦337923 any \add vision\add* \add ≈won't¦337922 end well\add*.
\v 4 Yisrael¦337928, your¦337927 prophets¦337927 have¦337929 been¦337929 like¦337925 jackals in the wastelands.
\v 5 You¦337932 haven't gone¦337932 to the breaks¦337933 in¦337933 the \add #walls\add* around the¦337938 Israeli¦337939 \add cities\add* and repaired them, in order to \add ≈be able to defend yourselves well during¦337941\add* the battle¦337941 on¦337942 Yahweh's¦337943 \add chosen\add* day¦337942.
\v 6 The people have¦337945 false visions¦337945 and¦337947 make false¦337948 predictions. Yahweh¦337953 hasn't sent¦337955 those¦337949 who¦337949 say¦337949 that they're bringing Yahweh's declaration¦337950, \add ≈but¦337956 nevertheless they've¦337956 made people hope that their messages¦337958 would come true\add*.
\v 7 Haven't you¦337964 had false \add #visions¦337964\add* and¦337965 made false predictions—all of¦337965 you¦337967 who say¦337967 that you're¦337968 bringing Yahweh's¦337971 declaration¦337969 when¦337972 I myself haven't spoken¦337974?’
\p
\v 8 Therefore the master¦337980 Yahweh¦337981 says¦337979 this, ‘Because¦337982 you¦337983 \add people\add* have¦337983 \add ≈presented\add* false¦337986 visions¦337985 and¦337985 have¦337985 told¦337983 lies¦337986, this is¦337989 the¦337990 master¦337991 Yahweh's¦337992 declaration¦337990 against¦337989 you¦337989:
\v 9 \add ≈I'll punish\add* the¦337998 prophets¦337998 who¦337999 have lying visions¦337999 and¦338001 who¦338001 make false¦338002 predictions. They won't be \add allowed\add* in¦338003 the¦338003 assembly of¦338003 my¦338004 people¦338004, or enrolled in¦338008 the record of Yisrael's¦338011 \add ≈descendants\add*. They¦338013 mustn't go¦338019 to¦338014 the¦338016 land¦338016 of¦338016 Yisrael¦338017—\add ≈that's how\add* you¦338020 \add people\add* will¦338020 know¦338020 that¦338021 I¦338022 am the master¦338023 Yahweh¦338024.
\p
\v 10 Also because¦338026 they¦338028 led¦338028 my¦338031 people¦338031 astray¦338028 and said¦338032, “Peace¦338033,” when¦338034 there's¦338034 no peace¦338035,\x + \xo 13:10: \xt Jer 6:14; 8:11.\x* \add it's as if\add* they're building¦338037 a¦338038 wall¦338038 and¦338039 then whitewashing¦338042 it¦338041.’
\v 11 Tell¦338044 the ones who¦338047 are¦338047 whitewashing¦338048 the¦338060 wall¦338060 that it'll¦338049 fall¦338049 down. There'll be a downpour, then I'll send hailstones to make it¦338050 fall¦338057 down, and¦338058 a strong wind to break¦338060 it down.
\v 12 See¦338062, the¦338064 wall¦338064 will fall¦338063 down. Haven't others \add ≈asked¦338066\add* you¦338067 where¦338068 the¦338069 white coating \add went\add* that¦338070 you¦338071 put on it?
