\v 13 Therefore my¦338077 master¦338077 Yahweh¦338078 says¦338076 this: ‘In my rage, I'll¦338079 bring a¦338080 storm, and in¦338083 my¦338083 anger¦338086, there'll be \add ≈heavy rain¦338084 causing floods¦338085\add*. In¦338090 my rage¦338090, hailstones will completely¦338091 \add ≈destroy¦338091\add* \add @Yerushalem\add* \add !(Jerusalem)\add*.
