\p
\v 15 In my¦338119 rage¦338119 I'll¦338116 annihilate the wall¦338120 and¦338121 those¦338129 who whitewashed it¦338122. I'll¦338124 tell¦338124 you¦338125, “The¦338127 wall¦338127 doesn't exist anymore, nor do the people who¦338129 whitewashed it¦338130—
\v 16 those Israeli¦338133 prophets¦338132 who¦338134 prophesied¦338134 about¦338136 Yerushalem¦338138 and¦338139 had \add #visions¦338141\add* of¦338141 peace¦338142 for it. But¦338143 there¦338143 isn't¦338143 any peace¦338144! That's the¦338145 master¦338146 Yahweh's¦338147 declaration¦338145.” ’
