\v 17 \add ≈So¦338150\add*, son¦338151 of¦338151 humanity¦338153, \add ≈turn your¦338155 attention to\add* your¦338159 people's¦338159 daughters¦338158 and prophesy against¦338156 them \add ≈because they invented prophecies¦338160 in their¦338161 own¦338161 imaginations\add*.
