\v 19 You've¦338198 profaned¦338198 me¦338200 among my people for¦338204 handfuls¦338204 of¦338204 barley¦338205 and¦338206 crumbs of¦338206 bread¦338207. \add ≡You people have\add* killed¦338208 people¦338209 who¦338210 shouldn't¦338211 have died¦338213, and¦338214 saved the lives¦338214 of those who¦338216 shouldn't¦338217 have continued to live¦338219, because of your lies¦338220 to¦338221 my people who¦338222 heard you.
\p
\v 20 Therefore my¦338231 master¦338231 Yahweh¦338232 says¦338229 this: ‘I'm¦338233 against¦338234 the magic charms that¦338237 you've¦338238 used to \add ≈lure\add* the¦338243 people¦338243 in as if they were birds¦338244. Indeed, I'll¦338245 tear¦338245 them¦338246 from¦338247 your¦338248 arms¦338248, and¦338249 I'll¦338249 let the¦338252 people¦338252 you've¦338254 trapped like birds¦338259 go free¦338249.
