\v 22 Because¦338282 you've discouraged¦338283 the¦338286 righteous¦338286 \add >people\add* with lies¦338287 (even though I¦338288 didn't¦338289 desire their discouragement), and¦338291 because you \add people\add* \add ≈encouraged¦338291 the¦338292 actions\add* of¦338292 the¦338293 wicked¦338293 \add >people\add* instead so they won't¦338294 change¦338296 their \add #ways¦338297\add* to¦338299 save¦338299 their lives¦338299,
