\v 4 Therefore tell them that the master¦338367 Yahweh¦338368 says¦338365 this: ‘Every Israeli¦338372 person who¦338373 \add ≈makes their idols¦338377 their priority\add*, or who \add ≈allows their disobedience to¦338378 separate them from me\add*, and¦338381 who then¦338386 comes¦338386 to¦338387 a prophet¦338389, I¦338390, Yahweh¦338391, will¦338392 answer¦338392 them according to¦338393 \add ≈how many idols¦338397 they have\add*.
