\v 7 Any \add ≈Israeli person\add* or any foreigner¦338441 residing in¦338445 Yisrael¦338445 \add !(Israel¦338445)\add* who deserts me, who takes idols¦338449 \add ≈to be their gods\add* and¦338446 \add ≈allows their disobedience to separate¦338446 them from¦338447 me¦338447\add*, and who then comes¦338458 to¦338459 a prophet¦338461 to¦338462 \add ≈request my guidance\add*, I¦338466, Yahweh¦338467, will¦338468 answer¦338468 that person myself¦338471.
