\v 9 If¦338491 a prophet is¦338493 deceived¦338493 and¦338494 speaks¦338494 a¦338495 message¦338495, then I¦338496, Yahweh¦338497, will deceive¦338498 that¦338501 prophet. I'll¦338502 \add ≈take action\add* against him¦338506 and¦338507 destroy¦338507 him¦338507 \add to remove him\add* from¦338508 among¦338508 the Israeli¦338510 people¦338509.
\v 10 \add ≈Both the prophet¦338517 and the one¦338515 who¦338515 asks¦338515 him for advice will¦338518 be¦338518 guilty, and I'll punish both of them for their disobedience.\add*
\v 11 Because of that¦338520, the¦338525 Israeli¦338527 people will no longer wander¦338523 away from¦338528 following me¦338528, nor defile¦338531 themselves¦338531 any longer through all¦338533 their¦338535 \add ≈disobedience\add*. They'll¦338536 be¦338536 my people¦338538, and¦338539 I'll¦338540 be their god¦338542. That's the¦338543 master¦338544 Yahweh's¦338545 declaration¦338543.’ ”
\s1 Turning the country into wasteland
