\v 12 Then¦338548 Yahweh¦338551 \add ≈gave\add* me¦338552 \add another\add* message¦338549:
\v 13 “Son¦338555 of¦338555 humanity¦338557, when a¦338558 \add ≈country¦338558\add* sins¦338560 against me¦338562 by¦338563 \add ≈choosing to worship other gods\add*, so¦338566 that I¦338566 \add ≈decide to take action\add* against it, \add ≈then¦338569\add* I'll¦338569 break¦338569 the \add ≈cycle of¦338571 food¦338573 production\add* and¦338574 send¦338574 a famine¦338577 out¦338566 over it¦338579. I'll \add ≈punish\add* both people¦338580 and¦338581 animals¦338581 from that land¦338558
