\v 23 The survivors will¦338775 relieve you¦338776 \add people\add* when you¦338779 see¦338779 their¦338782 behaviour and¦338783 their¦338785 actions, because you'll¦338786 know¦338786 that¦338787 all¦338792 those things that¦338794 I've¦338796 done¦338796 against \add @Yerushalem¦338797\add*, I \add ≈didn't¦338788 do them without¦338789 good reason¦338789\add*. That's the¦338798 master¦338799 Yahweh's¦338800 declaration¦338798.”
