\v 3 Do¦338835 people¦338835 take¦338835 wood¦338830 from¦338836 \add @a vine\add* to make anything? Would anyone \add ≈use\add* \add @vine wood\add* \add even\add* to make something to¦338838 hang¦338838 a mug on¦338839?
\v 4 If it's¦338846 \add ≈used as firewood\add*, and if the¦338849 fire burns both¦338849 ends¦338850, and¦338853 even the¦338853 middle¦338853, is it¦338855 good \add wood, or indeed good\add* for¦338856 anything?
\v 5 \add ≈Originally,\add* \add @the vine wood\add* couldn't \add be used to\add* make¦338862 anything, so surely, when¦338859 the fire's¦338867 burnt it, it still can't¦338861 do anything useful.
