\v 8 Then¦338918 I'll¦338918 make¦338918 the¦338921 land¦338921 into an abandoned wasteland¦338922 because¦338923 they¦338924 \add ≈chose to worship other gods\add*. That's the¦338926 master¦338927 Yahweh's¦338928 declaration¦338926.”
\c 16
