\p
\v 1 Then¦338931 Yahweh¦338934 \add ≈gave\add* me¦338935 \add another\add* message¦338932:
\v 2 “Son¦338938 of¦338938 humanity¦338940, inform¦338941 Yerushalem¦338944 \add !(Jerusalem¦338944)\add* about \add ≈their detestable¦338947 behaviour\add*,
\v 3 and¦338949 declare that the master¦338953 Yahweh¦338954 says¦338952 this to¦338955 Yerushalem¦338955: Your¦338956 beginning¦338956 and¦338957 your¦338957 birth¦338957 took place in the¦338958 land¦338958 of¦338958 Kena'an \add !(Canaan)\add*, your¦338960 father¦338960 was an Amori¦338961, and¦338962 your¦338962 mother¦338962 was¦338963 a¦338963 Hiti¦338963.\f + \fr 16:3 \ft A bunch of insults to the proud Israelis.\f*
\v 4 \add ≈When¦338965 you¦338968 were¦338967 born¦338967\add*, your mother didn't¦338969 cut¦338971 your¦338972 cord¦338972, nor did she clean¦338977 you with¦338973 water¦338973 or rub¦338980 you down with¦338980 salt¦338980, or wrap¦338981 cloth around you¦338983.
\v 5 No \add ≈one¦338992 cared enough\add* about you¦338988 to¦338991 do any of these¦338993 things for¦338994 you—to \add ≈be compassionate¦338994\add* toward you¦338995. Your¦339002 life¦339002 \add ≈was despised\add* \add and\add* you¦338996 were¦338996 thrown¦338996 out¦338996 into¦338997 the open field¦339000 on the \add very\add* day¦339003 that you¦339005 were¦339004 born¦339004.
\p
\v 6 But¦339007 I¦339007 went¦339007 past, and¦339009 I¦339009 saw¦339009 you¦339009, \add Yerushalem,\add* writhing in¦339011 your¦339011 own blood, so I said to you \add as you lay there\add* in your blood, “Live¦339019!”\f + \fr 16:6 \ft The last part of the verse is repeated in the Hebrew.\f*
\v 7 I¦339024 made¦339024 you grow¦339025 like¦339022 a plant¦339022 in the¦339023 countryside¦339023. You¦339026 grew¦339026 up¦339026 and became tall, and you¦339027 became the \add ≈most precious\add* jewel. \add &Your¦339028\add* breasts¦339030 became firm¦339031, and¦339032 your¦339032 hair¦339032 grew¦339033 thick, even though you'd¦339034 \add ≈been¦339035 naked¦339035\add* and¦339036 bare.
\p
\v 8 I¦339038 went¦339038 past \add again\add* and¦339040 saw¦339040 you¦339040. Wow¦339041, the time of love¦339044 came¦339052 for you, so¦339045 I¦339045 spread¦339045 my¦339046 robe¦339046 out¦339045 over¦339047 you¦339047 and¦339048 covered¦339048 your¦339049 nakedness¦339049. Then¦339050 I¦339050 \add ≈made a promise¦339050\add* to¦339051 you¦339051 and brought you into¦339053 a¦339053 contract and you¦339054 became mine. That's the¦339055 master¦339056 Yahweh's¦339057 declaration¦339055.
\p
\v 9 I¦339061 washed¦339061 you¦339061, \add Yerushalem,\add* with¦339062 water¦339062, and¦339063 rinsed your blood¦339064 off¦339063 you¦339065, and¦339066 I¦339066 \add ≈put lotion on¦339065 your skin\add*.
\v 10 Then¦339069 I¦339069 dressed¦339069 you¦339069 in embroidered clothes¦339069 and¦339071 put leather¦339072 sandals¦339071 on your feet. I¦339073 wrapped¦339073 you in fine linen¦339074, then¦339075 covered¦339075 you¦339075 with silk¦339076.
\v 11 Next I¦339078 adorned¦339078 you¦339078 with jewellery, and¦339080 I¦339080 put¦339080 bracelets¦339081 on¦339082 your¦339084 hands¦339084 and¦339085 a¦339085 chain¦339085 around your¦339088 neck¦339088.
\v 12 I¦339090 put¦339090 a¦339091 ring¦339091 in your¦339094 nose¦339094 and¦339095 earrings¦339095 in your¦339098 ears¦339098, and¦339099 a¦339099 beautiful¦339100 crown¦339099 on¦339101 your¦339101 head¦339101.
\v 13 \add ≈So¦339103\add* you¦339103 were adorned¦339103 with gold¦339104 and¦339105 silver¦339105, and you were¦339107 dressed in fine¦339107 linen¦339107, silk¦339109, and¦339110 embroidered clothes¦339106. You¦339114 ate¦339114 \add good food made from\add* fine¦339111 flour¦339111, honey¦339112, and¦339113 oil¦339113, and¦339116 you¦339116 were¦339116 very beautiful¦339116, and¦339119 you¦339119 became a queen.
\v 14 Your \add ≈reputation¦339124\add*, \add Yerushalem,\add* \add ≈spread\add* among¦339125 the nations¦339125 because of¦339126 your¦339126 beauty¦339126, because¦339127 it was¦339129 perfect¦339129 in the majesty I'd¦339134 given you¦339135. That's the¦339136 master¦339137 Yahweh's¦339138 declaration¦339136.
