\v 18 You¦339190 took¦339190 your¦339194 embroidered garments and¦339195 covered¦339195 \add @those¦339195 idols¦339195\add*, and¦339196 you \add ≈offered\add* my¦339196 \add #oils¦339196\add* and¦339197 perfumes to them¦339200.
