\v 20 Then¦339220 you¦339220 took¦339220 your¦339223 sons¦339223 and¦339224 daughters¦339226 that you¦339228 bore¦339228 for me¦339229, and¦339230 you¦339230 sacrificed¦339230 them¦339230 to¦339231 \add @those¦339231 idols¦339231\add* to¦339232 be devoured¦339232 as food. Are your acts of prostitution¦339234 a small¦339233 matter?
