\v 1 Then¦339965 Yahweh¦339968 \add ≈gave\add* me¦339969 \add another\add* message¦339966:
\v 2 “Son¦339972 of¦339972 humanity¦339974, present a riddle and¦339977 tell¦339977 a parable to the¦339981 \add ≈Israeli¦339982 people\add*.
