\v 4 He broke off¦340016 the¦340014 top¦340014 \add #shoot¦340015\add* of¦340015 \add @the tree\add* and¦340017 took¦340017 it¦340017 to¦340018 Kena'an \add !(Canaan)\add* \add where he\add* placed¦340024 it in¦340022 a¦340022 city¦340022 \add full\add* of¦340022 merchants¦340023.
