\v 6 Then¦340041 \add @the¦340041 seed¦340041\add* sprouted¦340041 and¦340042 became a¦340043 spreading vine¦340043 low¦340045 to¦340047 the ground. Its branches turned¦340047 toward him¦340049, and¦340050 its¦340050 roots¦340050 grew \add ≈down below\add*, so¦340053 it¦340053 became¦340053 a¦340054 vine¦340054 and¦340055 produced¦340055 branches and¦340057 sent¦340057 out¦340057 shoots¦340056.
