\v 24 then¦340402 all¦340403 the¦340405 trees¦340405 in the¦340406 countryside¦340406 will¦340402 know¦340402 that¦340407 I¦340408 am Yahweh¦340409. I¦340410 bring¦340410 down the high trees¦340412 and I¦340414 raise¦340414 up¦340414 the low¦340416 trees¦340418. I¦340417 wither the watered tree and¦340420 I¦340420 cause¦340420 the wilted tree¦340421 to bloom. I¦340423 am Yahweh¦340424. I've¦340425 declared that that will happen, and¦340426 I¦340426 will¦340426 do¦340426 it.’ ”
