\p
\v 1 \add ≈Seven years¦341188\add* \add after we'd been taken to Bavel\add* \add !(Babylon)\add*, \add ≈some\add* Israeli¦341196 elders¦341195 came¦341193 to¦341197 \add ≈get me to ask Yahweh¦341200 for advice for them\add*.
