\v 6 on that day¦341280 I¦341282 raised¦341282 my¦341283 hand¦341283 to \add ≈make a promise\add* to them that I would bring¦341285 them¦341285 out¦341285 of¦341286 Mitsrayim¦341287 into¦341288 a¦341290 land¦341290 that¦341291 I'd¦341293 \add carefully\add* selected¦341293 for¦341294 them¦341294. It was flowing¦341295 with milk¦341296 and¦341297 honey¦341297—it was¦341298 the most beautiful¦341298 of all¦341300 the¦341302 lands¦341302.
\v 7 I¦341304 told¦341304 them¦341305, “Let each \add ≈family\add* throw¦341309 away¦341309 their Mitsri¦341311 \add !(Egyptian¦341311)\add* idols¦341310, plus \add ≈any other detestable¦341307 things¦341307 they have\add*. Don't¦341312 \add ≈defile¦341314\add* yourselves¦341314. I¦341315 am¦341316 Yahweh¦341316 your¦341317 god¦341317.”
\v 8 \add ≈But¦341319\add* they¦341319 rebelled¦341319 against¦341321 me¦341321 and¦341322 were¦341323 unwilling to¦341324 listen¦341324 to¦341325 me¦341325. \add *They\add* didn't¦341331 throw¦341332 away¦341332 the¦341335 detestable¦341329 things¦341329 \add ≈they¦341338 had\add* or abandon¦341338 their Mitsri idols¦341335, so¦341339 I¦341339 determined to¦341340 pour¦341340 my fury out¦341340 on¦341342 them¦341342 to¦341343 satisfy my¦341344 rage¦341341 among them¦341345 \add ≈right there\add* in¦341346 Mitsrayim¦341348.
\v 9 I¦341350 \add ≈did¦341350 that to protect my reputation¦341352\add* so¦341350 it wouldn't be¦341354 \add ≈tarnished\add* in the¦341355 eyes¦341355 of¦341355 the¦341356 nations¦341356 \add ≈where they¦341359 were¦341360 staying\add*. I¦341362 made¦341362 myself¦341362 \add ≈clearly\add* known¦341362 to¦341363 them¦341363\f + \fr 20:9 \ft them: Probably referring to those countries, but some translations interpret it to refer to the ones being brought out.\f* by¦341365 bringing¦341365 them¦341365 out¦341365 of¦341366 Mitsrayim¦341367.
\p
\v 10 \add ≈So¦341369\add* I¦341369 led them¦341369 out¦341369 of¦341370 Mitsrayim¦341371 and¦341372 took¦341372 them¦341372 into¦341373 the¦341375 wilderness¦341375.
\v 11 Then¦341377 I¦341377 gave¦341377 them¦341378 my¦341381 instructions and¦341382 regulations¦341381—\add ≈anyone who follows\add* them will live¦341391.\x + \xo 20:11-13: \xt Lev 18:5.\x*
