\v 13 \add ≈But¦341410 the¦341413 Israeli¦341415 people¦341428\add* rebelled¦341410 against¦341412 me¦341412 in¦341416 the wilderness¦341416. They¦341420 \add ≈wouldn't follow my instructions\add*, and they¦341424 rejected¦341424 my¦341417 regulations¦341417, \add even though\add* anyone who obeys them¦341427 will¦341429 live¦341429. They severely disrespected my rest days, so¦341436 I¦341436 said¦341436 I'd pour¦341437 my fury¦341438 out¦341437 on¦341439 them¦341439 in¦341440 the wilderness¦341440 in order to¦341441 end¦341441 them¦341441.
