\v 15 \add ≈So¦341454\add* I myself \add ≈took action by making a promise\add* to¦341459 them¦341459 in¦341460 the wilderness¦341460 not¦341461 to¦341462 bring¦341462 them¦341463 into¦341464 the¦341466 land¦341466 that¦341467 I'd¦341469 been going to give¦341469 them—a land flowing¦341470 with milk¦341471 and¦341472 honey¦341472, which¦341467 was¦341473 the most beautiful¦341473 out of all¦341475 the¦341477 lands¦341477.\x + \xo 20:15: \xt Num 14:26-35.\x*
