\v 24 I decided to do that since¦341625 they hadn't obeyed my instructions, and since they'd¦341631 rejected¦341631 my¦341630 regulations¦341630 and¦341632 disrespected my¦341634 rest days—\add ≈they¦341635 really wanted\add* their ancestors' idols¦341637.
