\v 46 So¦343936 the master¦343938 Yahweh¦343939 says¦343937 this: I'll bring¦343940 a¦343942 group¦343942 \add to attack\add* \add @Shomron\add* \add !(Samaria)\add* \add @ and Yerushalem\add* \add !(Jerusalem)\add* and¦343943 give them¦343944 up¦343940 to¦343945 be terrorized¦343945 and¦343946 plundered¦343946.
\v 47 Then¦343948 that group¦343951 will¦343948 stone¦343948 them¦343949 with stones¦343950 and¦343952 cut¦343952 them down with¦343954 their¦343954 swords¦343954. They'll¦343957 kill¦343957 their \add ≈children¦343955\add* and¦343956 burn¦343960 down their¦343956 houses¦343958.
\v 48 \add That's how\add* I'll¦343962 remove shameful behaviour from¦343964 the¦343966 land¦343966, and¦343967 discipline all¦343968 the¦343970 women¦343970 so¦343971 they'll¦343972 no longer act like¦343973 prostitutes.
\v 49 They'll use your¦343976 shameful behaviour against you¦343977. You'll¦343980 all bear¦343980 the guilt of the¦343978 sins¦343978 you did with your¦343979 idols¦343979, and¦343981 in that way you'll¦343981 know¦343981 that¦343982 I¦343983 am the master¦343984 Yahweh¦343985.”
\c 24
\s1 The rusty cooking pot
