\v 2 “Son¦344001 of¦344001 humanity¦344003, write¦344004 down \add ≈the day and month\add* for¦344007 yourself¦344007, because on this exact day, the Babylonian king¦344018 \add ≈started his siege of¦344018\add* Yerushalem¦344023 \add !(Jerusalem¦344023)\add*.\x + \xo 24:2: \xt 2Ki 25:1.\x*
\v 3 \add ≈So¦344028 tell¦344028 this parable¦344028 to¦344029 the rebellious¦344033 Israeli people and¦344035 explain that it comes from\add* the master¦344039 Yahweh¦344040:
\q1 Pour¦344046 water¦344048 into the¦344042 cooking pot¦344042 and¦344044 place it on the fire.
