\q1 and¦344066 pile¦344067 up¦344067 the¦344068 \add ≈fuel\add* underneath¦344069 it—
\q1 keeping it boiling¦344070 to \add make sure\add* the bones¦344075 in¦344076 it¦344076 cook¦344074 \add well\add*.
