\v 17 You must groan¦344257 silently¦344259. Don't¦344262 \add ≈organise\add* a funeral \add ≈when¦344268 she's\add* dead¦344260. Put¦344269 on¦344270 your¦344270 turban¦344265 and¦344271 your sandals¦344268, but don't veil your¦344268 beard, or eat¦344279 the bread¦344276 of¦344276 men¦344277 who mourn¦344261 who've lost their wives.”
