\v 18 \add ≈So¦344281\add* I¦344281 spoke¦344281 to¦344282 the¦344284 people¦344284 in¦344285 the morning¦344285, and then¦344286 my¦344287 wife¦344287 died¦344286 in¦344288 the evening¦344288. In¦344290 the morning¦344290 I¦344292 did what I'd been¦344292 commanded¦344292 to do.
\v 19 Then¦344294 the¦344296 people¦344296 asked¦344294 me¦344295, “Won't¦344297 you¦344299 tell¦344299 us¦344300 what¦344301 these¦344303 \add >things\add* mean—the \add ≈way that¦344307 you're behaving\add*?”
