\v 2 “Son¦344453 of¦344453 humanity¦344455, \add ≈keep looking towards¦344458 the¦344460 Amonim\add*\x + \xo 25:2: \xt Jer 49:1-6; Eze 21:28-32; Amos 1:13-15; Zeph 2:8-11.\x* and¦344462 prophesy¦344462 against¦344458 them¦344463.
