\v 7 \add ≈Yes,\add* this is what Yahweh¦344859 says¦344858: Listen, I'm¦344861 bringing¦344862 the Babylonian¦344866 King¦344866 Nevukadnetsar¦344866 \add !(Nebuchadnezzar¦344866)\add*, king¦344867 of¦344867 kings¦344872, from¦344870 the¦344870 north¦344870, against¦344863 Tsor¦344865, with¦344873 horses¦344873 and¦344874 chariots¦344874, and¦344875 with¦344875 horsemen¦344875 and a \add ≈large army\add*.
