\v 11 The¦344919 hooves¦344919 of¦344919 his¦344920 horses¦344920 will¦344921 trample¦344921 all¦344924 of¦344924 your streets¦344926. He'll¦344929 slaughter¦344929 your people¦344927 with¦344928 the sword¦344928 and¦344930 your mighty \add stone\add* pillars¦344930 will \add ≈be knocked\add* to¦344932 the ground¦344932.
