\v 14 I'll¦344960 make¦344960 you¦344960 \add back into\add* a bare rock¦344962—you'll¦344965 become a¦344963 place¦344963 where nets¦344964 are¦344965 spread¦344963 \add out to dry\add*. You'll¦344967 never be¦344967 built¦344967 again¦344968, because¦344969 I¦344970, master Yahweh¦344971, have¦344972 spoken¦344972. That's the¦344973 master¦344974 Yahweh's¦344975 declaration¦344973.
