\v 20 then¦345083 I'll¦345083 take you¦345083 down¦345083 to the pit that¦345086 ancient people¦345090 went¦345086 down¦345086 to¦345088, because I'll¦345092 make¦345092 you¦345092 live¦345092 in¦345093 the¦345094 lowest¦345094 realms of the earth like¦345095 ancient ruins¦345095. Because of¦345099 that¦345101, you¦345103 won't¦345102 come back and¦345104 \add ≈be splendid¦345105\add* in¦345106 the land¦345106 of the¦345107 living¦345107.
\v 21 I'll¦345110 send disaster onto you¦345110, and¦345111 you¦345111 won't¦345111 exist anymore. Then¦345112 \add people\add* will look for you, but¦345113 you'll¦345115 never be¦345115 found¦345115 again¦345116.\x + \xo 26:21: \xt Rev 18:21.\x* That's the¦345118 master¦345119 Yahweh's¦345120 declaration¦345118.”
