\v 7 I'll¦345688 bring¦345689 foreigners against you¦345690—terrifying \add ≈warriors\add* from other nations¦345693. They'll¦345694 bring their¦345695 swords¦345695 against the¦345698 beauty¦345698 of¦345698 your¦345699 wisdom¦345699, and¦345700 they'll¦345700 defile¦345700 your¦345701 splendour¦345701.
