\v 9 Will¦345712 you¦345712 really¦345711 say¦345712, “I'm a¦345713 god¦345713” to¦345715 the¦345715 face¦345715 of¦345715 one¦345716 who's¦345716 \add about to\add* kill¦345716 you¦345716? You're¦345717 a¦345718 man¦345718 and¦345719 not¦345719 God¦345721, and you'll be \add ≈at the¦345722 mercy\add* of¦345722 the one who¦345723 \add ≈runs you¦345723 through\add*.
\v 10 You'll¦345727 die¦345727 \add ≈like an ungodly person killed by¦345728\add* foreigners¦345730, because¦345731 I've¦345733 declared it. That's the¦345734 master¦345735 Yahweh's¦345736 declaration.’ ”
