\v 6 Then¦347358 I'll¦347358 drench your land¦347359 with your¦347360 blood¦347361 \add across\add* to¦347362 the¦347364 hills¦347364,
\q1 and¦347365 the ravines¦347365 will¦347366 be¦347366 filled¦347366 with your blood.
