\v 7 Then¦347369 when¦347370 I \add ≈eliminate¦347370\add* you¦347370, I'll cover the heavens¦347371 and¦347372 darken¦347372 their¦347375 stars¦347375.
\q1 I'll cover the¦347376 sun¦347376 with¦347377 \add #clouds¦347377\add*, and¦347379 the¦347379 moon¦347379 won't¦347380 shine its¦347383 light.\x + \xo 32:7: \xt Mat 24:29; Rev 6:12-13; 8:12.\x*
