\v 8 I'll¦347390 darken¦347390 all¦347385 the¦347387 shining lights¦347388 in¦347389 the skies¦347389 over¦347391 you¦347391,
\q1 and¦347392 I'll¦347392 put¦347392 darkness¦347393 over¦347394 your¦347396 land¦347396. That's the¦347397 master¦347398 Yahweh's¦347399 declaration¦347397.
\p
\v 9 I'll¦347401 disturb¦347401 the¦347402 \add #hearts¦347402\add* of¦347402 many¦347404 people¦347403 groups in lands that¦347411 you don't¦347412 know \add about\add*
\q1 when¦347405 I bring¦347405 about¦347406 your¦347406 destruction among¦347407 the nations¦347407—among lands¦347410 you¦347414 haven't known¦347414.
\q1
\v 10 I'll¦347416 shock¦347416 many¦347419 people¦347418 groups \add ≈with what I'll do to\add* you.
\q1 Their¦347420 kings¦347420 will¦347421 shudder¦347421 in horror concerning you¦347422 when¦347424 I¦347424 swing my¦347425 sword¦347425 \add ≈towards\add* them.
\q1 On¦347426 the day¦347433 of¦347428 your¦347434 downfall¦347434 they'll¦347429 be trembling¦347429 \add ≈continuously\add* because¦347432 of¦347432 you.
\p
\v 11 \add ≈Yes,\add* the master¦347440 Yahweh¦347441 says¦347439 this \add to you, Mitsrayim\add* \add !(Egypt)\add*:
\q1 The¦347443 Babylonian king's¦347443 sword¦347442 will¦347446 come¦347446 against you¦347446.
\q1
\v 12 I'll¦347450 cause¦347450 large numbers of you to be killed by¦347448 warriors' swords¦347448—each warrior¦347449 a terror of¦347452 nations¦347453.
\q1 Those¦347454 warriors will¦347455 devastate¦347455 the¦347458 pride¦347458 of¦347458 Mitsrayim¦347459 and¦347460 destroy¦347460 all¦347461 its¦347463 \add ≈many¦347454 people¦347454\add*.
