\p
\v 23 Then¦348280 Yahweh¦348283 \add ≈gave\add* me¦348284 \add another\add* message¦348281:
\v 24 “Son¦348287 of¦348287 humanity¦348289, the¦348290 people inhabiting those¦348292 ruins¦348291 \add back\add* in Yisrael¦348296 \add !(Israel¦348296)\add* are¦348297 saying¦348297, ‘Avraham¦348301 was only one¦348299 person, and¦348302 he¦348302 inherited¦348311 the¦348305 land¦348305, \add ≈but¦348306 there's lots of us¦348308\add* \add now\add*. The¦348310 land¦348310 has¦348309 been¦348309 given¦348309 to¦348311 us as an inheritance.’
\p
\v 25 Therefore tell¦348315 them¦348316 that the master¦348321 Yahweh¦348322 says¦348319 this: You¦348327 eat¦348327 blood, and¦348328 you \add ≈pay your respect to¦348330\add* your¦348332 idols¦348332, then¦348333 you pour out people's blood¦348333. Should you¦348334 then¦348335 inherit¦348336 that land¦348335?
