\v 28 Then¦348387 I'll¦348387 turn the¦348390 \add ≈country¦348390\add* into a¦348391 desolation¦348391 and¦348392 a¦348392 horror, and¦348393 the¦348394 pride¦348394 \add ≈that came from its¦348395 power¦348395\add* will¦348393 end¦348393, because Yisrael's¦348398 mountains¦348397 will¦348396 be¦348396 deserted¦348396, and there'll be no one¦348400 to \add ≈walk¦348400\add* through¦348400 them.’
