\p
\v 1 Then¦349067 Yahweh¦349070 \add ≈gave\add* me¦349071 \add another\add* message¦349068:
\v 2 “Son¦349074 of¦349074 humanity¦349076, \add ≈look out towards\add* Mt¦349081. Se'ir¦349082\x + \xo 35:2: \xt Isa 34:5-17; 63:1-6; Jer 49:7-22; Eze 25:12-14; Amos 1:11-12; Oba 1-14; Mal 1:2-5.\x* and¦349083 prophesy¦349083 against it¦349084.
\v 3 Tell¦349086 it¦349087 that the master¦349090 Yahweh¦349091 says¦349089 this: Listen, I'm¦349092 against¦349093 you¦349093 \add Edom, represented by\add* Mt¦349094. Se'ir¦349096, and¦349097 I'll¦349097 \add ≈work against you¦349099 to\add* make¦349100 you¦349100 a¦349101 desolation¦349101 and¦349102 a¦349102 waste¦349102.
\v 4 I'll¦349106 \add ≈turn\add* your¦349104 cities¦349104 into \add #ruins¦349105\add*, and¦349107 you yourself will¦349109 become \add ≈desolate¦349108\add*. Then¦349110 you'll¦349110 know¦349110 that¦349111 I¦349113 am¦349114 Yahweh¦349114.
