\p
\v 1 “Now, son¦349315 of¦349315 humanity¦349317, prophesy¦349318 to¦349319 Yisrael's¦349322 \add !(Israel¦349322)\add* mountains and¦349323 say¦349323, ‘Mountains¦349324 of¦349324 Yisrael¦349325, listen¦349326 to Yahweh's¦349329 message¦349327.
