\v 18 This is the master¦350867 Yahweh's¦350868 declaration¦350866: When¦350855 Gog¦350861 attacks Yisrael¦350865 \add !(Israel¦350865)\add*, my fury¦350870 will¦350869 mount¦350869 up \add ≈into¦350871 a rage¦350870\add*.
\v 19 In¦350873 my¦350873 zeal and¦350873 in¦350874 the¦350874 fire¦350874 of¦350874 my¦350876 anger¦350876, I¦350877 declare that on that day¦350882 there'll be¦350884 a terrible¦350876 earthquake¦350885 in Yisrael¦350889,
\v 20 and the¦350893 fish¦350893 in the¦350894 sea¦350894 and¦350895 the \add #birds¦350895\add* in the¦350896 skies¦350896, the¦350897 wild animals¦350897 in the¦350898 countryside¦350898 including¦350899 all¦350899 the¦350901 creatures that¦350908 crawl on¦350903 the¦350905 earth, and¦350906 every¦350906 person¦350907 who's on¦350909 the¦350911 surface¦350911 of¦350911 the¦350912 land¦350912 will tremble¦350891 \add ≈in¦350892 front¦350892 of¦350892\add* me¦350892. The¦350914 mountains¦350914 will¦350913 be¦350913 thrown¦350913 down¦350913 and the¦350916 cliffs¦350916 will¦350915 fall¦350915, until every¦350917 wall¦350919 falls to¦350920 the ground¦350920.
\v 21 I'll¦350923 summon¦350923 \add ≈an army\add* against \add @Gog\add* on all¦350925 my¦350927 mountains¦350927. Every man's sword¦350928 will be against his¦350934 brother¦350934. That's the¦350929 master¦350930 Yahweh's¦350931 declaration¦350929.
\v 22 Then¦350937 I'll¦350937 \add ≈punish\add* \add @Gog¦350937\add* with¦350938 \add ≈deadly diseases\add* and¦350940 bloodshed¦350940, as well as overwhelming rain¦350941 and¦350943 hailstones and¦350946 burning¦350945 sulfur¦350946 that I'll¦350947 rain¦350947 down¦350947 on¦350948 him¦350948 and¦350949 his¦350951 troops¦350951 and¦350952 the many¦350955 nations¦350954 that¦350956 \add ≈joined\add* with¦350957 him¦350957.
