\p
\v 1 “Now, son¦350973 of¦350973 humanity¦350975, prophesy¦350976 against Gog¦350979 and¦350980 say¦350980 that the master¦350983 Yahweh¦350984 says¦350982 this: Listen, I'm¦350985 against¦350986 you¦350986, Gog¦350987, leader¦350988 of¦350989 Meshek¦350990 and¦350991 Tuval¦350991.
\v 2 I'll¦350993 turn¦350993 you¦350993 around¦350993 and¦350994 drag you¦350994 along—I'll¦350995 bring¦350995 you¦350995 from¦350996 the far north¦350997 and¦350998 take¦350998 you¦350998 up¦350995 to Yisrael's¦351002 \add !(Israel¦351002)\add* mountains¦351001,
\v 3 Then¦351004 I'll¦351004 knock your¦351005 bow¦351005 out of your¦351007 left¦351007 hand¦351007 and¦351008 make¦351011 the arrows¦351008 fall¦351011 out of your¦351010 right¦351010 hand.
\v 4 You¦351018 and¦351019 all¦351019 your¦351021 troops¦351021 and¦351022 soldiers who are¦351024 with¦351024 you will \add ≈die\add* on Yisrael's¦351016 mountains¦351015. I'll¦351032 give¦351032 you to¦351025 the birds¦351025 of¦351025 prey¦351025 and¦351030 the¦351030 wild animals¦351030 in the¦351031 countryside¦351031 for¦351033 food¦351033.
\v 5 You'll¦351039 \add ≈die\add* \add ≈there\add* in the countryside¦351038, because¦351040 I myself declare it. That's the¦351043 master¦351044 Yahweh's¦351045 declaration¦351043.
\v 6 Then¦351047 I'll¦351047 send¦351047 fire¦351049 out onto Magog¦351050 and¦351051 on¦351051 those¦351051 living¦351051 in safety¦351053 in the¦351052 \add ≈coastal¦351052 regions\add*, and¦351054 then they'll¦351054 know¦351054 that¦351055 I¦351057 am¦351058 Yahweh¦351058.
\v 7 I'll¦351064 make¦351064 my holy name known¦351064 among my¦351066 people¦351066 Yisrael¦351067, and¦351068 I'll¦351070 no longer allow¦351070 my holy name to be¦351070 profaned¦351070—the¦351073 nations¦351078 will¦351077 know¦351077 that¦351079 I¦351081 am¦351083 Yahweh¦351082, the holy¦351083 One in¦351084 Yisrael¦351084.
\p
\v 8 Listen, the¦351093 day¦351093 is¦351087 coming¦351087, and¦351088 \add @all¦351088 that¦351088\add* will¦351088 take place. That's the¦351089 master¦351090 Yahweh's¦351091 declaration¦351089.
\v 9 The¦351098 people living in Yisrael's¦351101 cities¦351100 will¦351097 go¦351097 out¦351097 and¦351102 they'll¦351102 use \add those\add* weapons¦351104 to kindle¦351102 and¦351103 make \add #fires¦351103\add* and¦351105 burn them—small shields¦351105, large shields¦351106, \add #bows¦351107\add*, arrows¦351108, the clubs¦351109 and¦351111 \add #spears¦351111\add*—they'll¦351112 make \add #fires\add* with them¦351113 for seven¦351115 years¦351116.
\v 10 They¦351120 won't \add need to\add* gather firewood¦351121 from¦351122 the¦351124 countryside¦351124 or cut¦351126 down trees from¦351127 the¦351129 forests¦351129, since¦351130 they'll¦351132 burn the weapons¦351131. They'll¦351135 take from those¦351138 \add invaders\add* who¦351138 wanted to take from them¦351138, and¦351139 plunder¦351139 those¦351142 who¦351142 wanted to plunder them¦351142. That's the¦351143 master¦351144 Yahweh's¦351145 declaration¦351143.”
\s1 Gog's burial
\rem /s1 The Burial of Gog
\p
\v 11 Then¦351148 \add ≈at that¦351150 time¦351149\add*, I'll¦351151 make a grave for Gog¦351152 there¦351156 in¦351158 Yisrael¦351158 \add !(Israel¦351158)\add*—a valley¦351159 for those¦351160 who¦351160 journey to the¦351161 east¦351161 of¦351161 the¦351162 sea¦351162. They'll bury¦351168 Gog¦351172 there with all¦351175 his¦351177 \add #multitudes¦351177\add*, and¦351179 they'll¦351179 call¦351179 it the¦351180 ‘Hamon¦351180-Gog¦351181’ \add (or, ‘Gog's horde’)\add* valley¦351182. \add @That mass grave\add* will block¦351163 people¦351168 who want to cross over.
\v 12 It'll take seven¦351192 months¦351193 for the¦351185 Israelis¦351186 to bury¦351184 them¦351184 to make the¦351191 area clean¦351188—
\v 13 all¦351196 the¦351199 land's¦351199 people¦351198 will¦351195 bury¦351195 them¦351195. It'll¦351200 be¦351200 a¦351202 memorable day¦351203 for them when I'm \add ≈honoured\add*. That's the master¦351206 Yahweh's¦351207 declaration¦351205.
\v 14 ⇔At the¦351226 end¦351226 of¦351226 the seven¦351227 months¦351229, they'll designate men to \add ≈continually¦351210\add* go through the \add ≈region\add* to find people¦351209 who were travelling through, but who died and their bodies remained¦351220 \add ≈above the ground\add*, so that they can bury¦351214 them¦351217 to make¦351230 the¦351224 land¦351224 clean¦351225.
\v 15 As those¦351233 men pass¦351233 through the¦351234 land¦351234, when¦351235 they¦351235 see¦351235 any human¦351237 bone¦351236, they'll¦351232 put a¦351240 marker¦351240 by¦351239 it¦351239, until¦351241 gravediggers come and bury¦351242 it¦351243 in the¦351247 Hamon¦351247-Gog¦351248 valley¦351249.
\v 16 There'll even be a¦351254 city¦351254 there named¦351252 ‘Hamonah¦351255’ \add (which means, ‘horde’ or ‘multitude’)\add*. In that way, they'll¦351256 make the¦351257 land¦351257 clean¦351256 \add again\add*.
\p
\v 17 Now, son¦351261 of¦351261 humanity¦351263, the master¦351268 Yahweh¦351269 says¦351270 this to¦351271 you: Tell all the winged birds¦351271 and¦351275 all¦351275 the¦351277 wild \add #animals¦351277\add* in the¦351278 countryside¦351278, ‘Gather¦351279 together and¦351280 come¦351280. Gather¦351281 from¦351282 all around¦351282 to¦351283 the sacrifice¦351285 that¦351286 I¦351287 myself am¦351288 making for¦351289 you¦351289—a¦351290 large¦351291 sacrifice¦351290 on¦351292 Yisrael's¦351294 mountains¦351293, so¦351295 that you¦351295 can eat¦351295 \add human\add* flesh¦351296 and¦351297 drink¦351297 blood¦351298.\x + \xo 39:17-20: \xt Rev 19:17-18.\x*
\v 18 You'll¦351302 eat¦351302 warriors'¦351301 flesh¦351300 and¦351303 drink¦351307 the¦351303 blood¦351303 of¦351303 the¦351306 \add ≈world's¦351306 leaders¦351305\add* as if they were rams¦351308, lambs¦351309, goats¦351310, and bulls¦351311 that were all¦351314 fattened¦351312 in Bashan¦351313.
\v 19 Then¦351316 you'll¦351316 eat¦351316 fat¦351318 until \add you're\add* full \add and\add* drink¦351320 blood¦351321 until \add you're\add* \add ≈drunk¦351322\add*—that'll be the sacrifice¦351323 that¦351324 I'll¦351326 slaughter for¦351327 you¦351327 \add birds and animals\add*.
\v 20 You'll¦351329 be¦351329 satisfied¦351329 at¦351330 my¦351332 table¦351332 with \add #horses¦351333, chariot drivers¦351334, warriors¦351335,\add* and¦351336 every¦351336 man¦351338 of¦351338 war¦351339. That's the¦351340 master¦351341 Yahweh's¦351342 declaration¦351340.’
\s1 Yisrael's restoration
