\p
\v 21 I'll¦351344 \add ≈display my¦351347 power\add* among¦351348 the nations¦351348, and¦351349 all¦351350 the¦351352 nations¦351352 will¦351349 see¦351349 \add ≈my judgement¦351355 that¦351356 I'll¦351357 put into process\add* and¦351358 \add ≈how I'll¦351363 put¦351363 that into action\add* against them¦351364.
