\v 23 The¦351380 nations¦351380 will¦351379 know¦351379 that¦351381 the¦351384 \add ≈Israeli¦351386 people\add* went¦351383 into¦351383 captivity because¦351381 of¦351386 how they¦351389 betrayed me¦351391 with their¦351400 \add ≈disobedience\add*, so¦351392 I¦351392 \add ≈distanced myself\add* from¦351394 them¦351394 and¦351395 \add ≈handed¦351395 them¦351395 over to\add* their¦351397 adversaries¦351397 so¦351398 that they¦351398 all¦351400 \add ≈died in the battle\add*.
\v 24 When¦351403 I¦351404 \add ≈distanced myself\add* from them¦351405, I¦351406 \add ≈treated them¦351408 exactly as their defilement¦351402 and¦351403 rebellion¦351403 deserved\add*.
