\v 25 Therefore the master¦351414 Yahweh¦351415 says¦351413 this: Now¦351416 I'll¦351417 restore Ya'akov's¦351422 \add !(Jacob¦351422)\add* fortunes, and¦351423 I'll¦351423 have¦351423 compassion¦351423 on¦351423 all¦351424 of¦351424 Yisrael's¦351427 \add !(Israel¦351427)\add* \add ≈descendants\add*, when¦351428 I¦351428 act with zeal¦351428 \add ≈to protect my¦351430 pure¦351430 reputation¦351429\add*.
\v 26 Then¦351432 they'll¦351432 bear¦351432 their¦351435 shame¦351435 and¦351436 all¦351438 the treason in which¦351441 they¦351442 betrayed me¦351444. They'll forget all that when¦351445 they¦351445 rest in their¦351448 land¦351448 in safety¦351449, with no one¦351451 to terrify¦351451 them
\v 27 \add when\add* I¦351453 restore them¦351454 from¦351455 the¦351457 people¦351457 groups and¦351458 gather¦351458 them¦351459 from¦351460 their¦351461 enemies'¦351461 lands¦351460, and¦351462 I¦351462 show¦351462 myself¦351462 in the¦351464 sight¦351464 of¦351464 many¦351466 nations¦351465 \add ≈to always do what's right\add*.
\v 28 Then¦351468 they'll¦351468 know¦351468 that¦351469 I¦351470 am¦351471 Yahweh¦351471 their¦351472 god¦351472, because¦351473 I¦351473 sent¦351473 them¦351474 into¦351475 captivity among the¦351477 \add other\add* nations¦351477, but then I'll¦351478 gather¦351478 them¦351478 back to¦351479 their \add own\add* land¦351481. I¦351484 won't¦351482 leave¦351484 any of them¦351486 among the nations.
\v 29 I'll¦351491 no longer \add ≈distance myself\add* from¦351494 them¦351494 when¦351489 I pour¦351496 out¦351496 my¦351499 spirit¦351499 on¦351500 the¦351502 \add ≈Israeli¦351503 people\add*. That's the¦351504 master¦351505 Yahweh's¦351506 declaration¦351504.”
\c 40
