\p
\v 24 Next the man took¦351940 me¦351940 to the gateway at the southern entrance, and¦351948 its¦351949 walls and¦351951 \add #porch¦351951\add* measured¦351948 the¦351953 same as the¦351954 other outer gates¦351945.
\v 25 There were closed windows¦351956 in the gateway and¦351958 its¦351958 \add #porch\add* just \add ≈like¦351963 the¦351963 other gates\add*. The¦351964 southern gate with its \add #porch\add* \add ≈was¦351965 twenty-seven metres long¦351967 and¦351968 thirteen metres wide¦351968\add*.
\v 26 There were¦351973 seven¦351974 steps¦351973 up to the gate and¦351977 its¦351977 \add #porch¦351977\add*, and¦351980 \add carvings of\add* palm¦351980 trees¦351980 on the walls on each side.
\v 27 There was a¦351991 gate¦351991 to¦351992 the¦351993 inner¦351993 courtyard¦351992 on the southern¦351995 side, and¦351996 the man measured¦351996 fifty-four metres¦352004 from¦351997 that gate¦351997 to¦351998 the¦352000 gate¦352000 at the southern¦352002 entrance.
\s1 The gateways to the inner courtyard
\rem /s1 Gates to the Inner Court; Gateways to the Inner Courtyard; The Inner Courtyard: The South Gate
\p
\v 28 Then¦352006 the man brought¦352006 me¦352006 to¦352007 the¦352010 inner¦352010 courtyard¦352009 by¦352011 way of¦352011 its southern¦352012 gate¦352016, which had the same measurements¦352018 as the¦352019 other gates.
\v 29 Its¦352021 chambers¦352021, walls, and¦352023 porches¦352025 \add ≈measured¦352027\add* the¦352027 same as the¦352028 other gates—there were windows¦352029 all around in the¦352038 porch. The¦352039 inner gate with its porch \add ≈was¦352040 twenty-seven metres long¦352038 and¦352041 thirteen metres¦352042 wide¦352039\add*.
\v 30 There were also¦352044 porches¦352044 all around the¦352048 inner wall—they were¦352049 \add all\add* \add ≈thirteen metres long¦352048 and almost three metres wide¦352052\add*.
\v 31 The \add #porch¦352056\add* facing the¦352061 outer¦352061 courtyard¦352060 had \add carved\add* palm¦352062 trees¦352062 on its¦352065 walls, and¦352067 eight¦352068 steps¦352067 going up to it.
\s1 The eastern gate to the inner courtyard
